    "Keep This Copy?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Garder cette copie ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep oldest" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Garder la plus ancienne"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps '%@' (%@) and removes the other %@. Every book that lists a removed copy already lists the kept one, so each book still has this recipe, once. Website copies of removed copies are taken down and shared books are refreshed. Can't be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Keeps '%1$@' (%2$@) and removes the other %3$@. Every book that lists a removed copy already lists the kept one, so each book still has this recipe, once. Website copies of removed copies are taken down and shared books are refreshed. Can't be undone."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Garde « %1$@ » (%2$@) et retire les autres %3$@. Chaque livre qui contient une copie retirée contient déjà celle conservée : chaque livre a donc toujours cette recette, une seule fois. Les copies web des copies retirées sont supprimées et les livres partagés sont actualisés. Irréversible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps '%@' and removes the other copies in this group that are in no book. Copies that are in a book are never removed. Website copies of removed copies are taken down." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Garde « %@ » et retire les autres copies de ce groupe qui ne sont dans aucun livre. Les copies qui sont dans un livre ne sont jamais retirées. Les copies web des copies retirées sont supprimées."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Key Length:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Longueur de la clé :"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Key will be saved directly without contacting recipe-api.com." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La clé sera enregistrée directement sans contacter recipe-api.com."
